    "win": "First dial to reach 30 during a crank wins immediately. Otherwise the game ends when the supply of gears and hubs is exhausted, or when a full round passes with no gear or hub placed and no Pull spent; the highest dial then wins, breaking ties by (1) higher dial number, (2) most unspent Pull Tokens, (3) fewest gears and hubs between the Drive Gear and the gear the dial reads, (4) of those still tied, the player who takes their turn soonest starting from the player left of the last cranker."
